    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Lattice Profiler.</strong> You can run a mental profiler on the world’s underlying lattice and get a sanity check back.</p><ul><li>Once per scene, you can spend an action or one minute of focused observation to “profile” a <strong>hex, faction, or Spark</strong>.</li><li>Make an <strong>Occult (Mind) or Insight (Soul)</strong> check (DC set by the GM). On a success, you get a <strong>diagnostic summary</strong>: current tilt, major stressors, hidden risks, and the single most effective kind of action to improve its state (violence, diplomacy, Tikkun, infrastructure, etc.).</li><li>Even on a failure, the GM may give you a “noisy” read: you know something is badly off, just not what.</li></ul>",
